# Copy to .env and fill in to take the lead forms live.
#
# Where the quote, contact, booking and referral forms POST their JSON payload.
# Works with any handler that accepts a JSON POST — Formspree, Basin, a Netlify
# function, or your own API. Leave unset and the forms validate and show their
# success state without sending anything (demo mode).
VITE_FORM_ENDPOINT=
